        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "X. During the term of this Agreement, the Employer will not reduce the scheduled hours of its regular full-time employees on the payroll as of November 15, 1980, (except in cases in which the reduction has occurred in accordance with the parties' side letter regarding the proper interpretation of Section N of Article 10 Seniority), until the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
