        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) Notwithstanding the provisions above, the Employer will assign work on seniority basis to a full-time employee in more than one store in an area to maintain his or her forty (40) hour schedule. If said employee refuses said assignment, he or she forfeits their claim to the scheduled hours.",
