        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Z. When a full-time employee in the Journeyman or Weighers and Wrappers classifications desires to move to another store in his or her seniority area, the employee will give notification, in writing, to an official designated by the Employer, with a copy to the Union, specifying the store to which he or she desires to move. When there is a bona fide vacancy in his or her classification in such store, the employee's request for transfer will be considered based on seniority and ability to perform the work.",
            "block_bbox": [
