        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Seafood Clerks hired after ratification of this agreement shall have seniority in the Seafood Department only. Should a Seafood Clerk desire promotion to a higher classification, such Clerk shall make their wishes known to their Zone Manager in writing with copies to the Personnel Manager and the Union. Such Seafood Clerk will be considered by seniority from those who have made their wishes known in writing.",
